{"product_id":"halo-turkish-tobacco-nic-salt","title":"Halo Turkish Tobacco Nic Salt","description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c!--StartFragment --\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eHalo Turkish Tobacco nicotine salt \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eblend offers an excellent combination of sun-cured tobacco flavor with a very light semi-sweet top note. This unique nic salt \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eflavor is characteristic of the original Turkish Tobacco cultivated off the coast of the Black Sea, which is widely used in traditional cigarettes and blended into various pipe tobaccos. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003eTurkish Tobacco by Halo \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"cf0\"\u003ehas a relatively mild tobacco flavor, so it is a great choice for “light tobacco” smokers still seeking substantial throat hit and good vapor production\u003c\/span\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSize: 30ml\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStrength: 20mg, 35mg and 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Halo","offers":[{"title":"20MG","offer_id":41846912614455,"sku":"Halo Turkish Tobacco - 20 MG","price":2039.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41846912647223,"sku":"Halo Turkish Tobacco - 35 MG","price":2039.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41846912679991,"sku":"Halo Turkish Tobacco - 50 MG","price":2039.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/halo-turkish-tobacco-nic-salt.webp?v=1756177857","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/halo-turkish-tobacco-nic-salt","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":